c['PFPINFRA-C019']={'id':'PFPINFRA-C019','claim':'The generated prompt schema/type DSL explicitly separates template placeholders, candidate assertions, custody and authority and delegates semantic source/lineage/containment/cross-reference checks to runtime. Structural schema success alone is intentionally insufficient.','evidence':[ev(532,2381,2387),ev(534,1,1350),ev(561,1,f[561]['lines'])],'dependencies':['Actual host validators','Pinned source and response bytes','Budget ledger and checker result binding'],'limitations':['Some other exported schemas are materially weaker than their descriptions, as F058/F059 show. No schema admission is treated as a mathematical theorem or trusted execution receipt.']}
